---
<BaseLayout title={page.title} ogType="website" description="Dinweys Biotech connects global buyers with premium Chinese feed additive manufacturers. Whether you need choline chloride , betaine, DCP , amino acids,..." canonical="/contact/" hreflang={hreflang}>
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<div class="entry-content single-content"><div class="wp-block-kadence-rowlayout alignnone"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column57_ef004b-58"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><h2 class="kt-adv-heading57_3274eb-e0 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading57_3274eb-e0">Contact Dinweys Biotech for Feed Additive Sourcing</h2><p>Dinweys Biotech connects global buyers with premium Chinese <a href="/product/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="4" title="Feed additives">feed additive</a> manufacturers. Whether you need <a href="/product/choline-chloride-60/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="1" title="Choline Chloride 60% Feed Additive – Corn Cob Carrier China Manufacturer Supply">choline chloride</a>, betaine, <a href="/product/dcp-dicalcium-phosphate-17/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="5" title="DCP17">DCP</a>, amino acids, <a href="/product_category/vitamins/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="2" title="vitamins">vitamins</a>, or enzymes, our team provides competitive pricing, quality documentation, and reliable logistics. Contact us today to discuss your requirements.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id57_91d44b-f2 alignfull wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-row kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column57_07b8e8-5f"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><h2 class="kt-adv-heading57_852bed-99 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading57_852bed-99">Get in Touch</h2><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@dinweys.com">info@dinweys.com</a></p><p><strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> +86 13610811901</p><p><strong>Office Location:</strong> Anhui, China</p><p><strong>Business Hours:</strong> Monday–Friday, 09:00–18:00 (CST)</p><p><strong>Response Time:</strong> Within 24 hours for all inquiries</p><h2 class="kt-adv-heading57_78538c-9c wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading57_78538c-9c">Our Product Range</h2><ul><li><strong>Choline Chloride</strong> — 60% corn cob, 60% silica, 50% corn cob, 75% liquid</li><li><strong>Betaine</strong> — Betaine HCl 96%/98%, Betaine Anhydrous</li><li><strong>Dicalcium Phosphate (DCP)</strong> — DCP 17% and <a href="/product/dcp-18-powder/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="6" title="DCP18">DCP 18</a>%</li><li><strong>Phytase &amp; Enzymes</strong> — Heat-stable phytase, granular phytase</li><li><strong>Amino Acids</strong> — L-Lysine Sulphate 70%, DL-Methionine, L-Threonine</li><li><strong>Vitamins</strong> — B2 (Riboflavin), C (Ascorbic Acid), E, A, D3</li></ul><p>Each product is supplied with complete documentation: Certificate of Analysis (COA), HPLC/LC-MS traces, heavy metal analysis, and microbiological testing reports.</p></div></div><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column57_4bd7d4-cb"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><h2 class="kt-adv-heading57_9e9bc7-4b wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading57_9e9bc7-4b">How to Place an Order</h2><ol><li><strong>Submit Inquiry</strong> — Send your product list and volume requirements</li><li><strong>Receive Quotation</strong> — Get competitive pricing within 24 hours</li><li><strong>Quality Review</strong> — Request COA, samples, and third-party testing</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation</strong> — Agree on terms, payment, and shipping schedule</li><li><strong>Production &amp; Inspection</strong> — Factory production with quality checkpoint</li><li><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery</strong> — FOB, CIF, or DDP to your destination port</li></ol><p>We serve feed mills, import distributors, and animal nutrition companies worldwide. <strong>Dinweys Biotech</strong> is your reliable partner for feed additive procurement from China.</p></div></div></div></div></div>`} />
  </article>

</BaseLayout>
